{"3196360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dream Shark - Pt. 1", "steam_appid": 3196360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196360/extras/6541e422fd0db9f5603dc7320c08add6.avif?t=1747323792\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an escapist child’s VR mask breaks, he begins to have intense nightmares. He must learn presence through his dream characters to face the shadowy beast he runs from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>TAC</strong>, a <strong>cyborg cyclops child</strong> living on the <strong>moon in the year 2300</strong>. TAC racks up points in virtual reality and explores the <strong>futuristic moonscape</strong> with a jetpack to avoid the struggles of family life. But when his routine is disrupted, he’s pulled into a journey deep within his subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter TAC’s <strong>dreamscape</strong>—a <strong>lush crystal island</strong> inhabited by an <strong>advanced society of axolotls</strong>. Solve <strong>puzzles, challenges, and hidden mysteries</strong> to unlock mini-games and extras, helping TAC become lucid and take control of his dream - <strong>but beware, the Dream Shark is always lurking.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Constantly Evolving Experience</strong> – Gameplay shifts between <strong>top-down exploration, platforming, isometric puzzles, faux-3D sequences, and shoot ‘em ups</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Worlds, One Journey</strong> – Explore the <strong>tech-dominated moon</strong> and <strong>the organic dream island</strong>, each with distinct environments, characters, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive &amp; Accessible Gameplay</strong> – Simple controls with clear guidance make it easy to jump in, though basic reading comprehension is required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fully Original Chiptune Soundtrack</strong> – Immerse yourself in a dynamic score that adapts to TAC’s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic 8-Bit Pixel Art</strong> – A richly detailed retro aesthetic, handcrafted for an authentic Game Boy experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by One Developer</strong> – A passion project built entirely by <strong>Benjamin McCarthy</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to face the <strong>Dream Shark</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196360/extras/6541e422fd0db9f5603dc7320c08add6.avif?t=1747323792\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an escapist child’s VR mask breaks, he begins to have intense nightmares. He must learn presence through his dream characters to face the shadowy beast he runs from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>TAC</strong>, a <strong>cyborg cyclops child</strong> living on the <strong>moon in the year 2300</strong>. TAC racks up points in virtual reality and explores the <strong>futuristic moonscape</strong> with a jetpack to avoid the struggles of family life. But when his routine is disrupted, he’s pulled into a journey deep within his subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter TAC’s <strong>dreamscape</strong>—a <strong>lush crystal island</strong> inhabited by an <strong>advanced society of axolotls</strong>. Solve <strong>puzzles, challenges, and hidden mysteries</strong> to unlock mini-games and extras, helping TAC become lucid and take control of his dream - <strong>but beware, the Dream Shark is always lurking.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Constantly Evolving Experience</strong> – Gameplay shifts between <strong>top-down exploration, platforming, isometric puzzles, faux-3D sequences, and shoot ‘em ups</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Worlds, One Journey</strong> – Explore the <strong>tech-dominated moon</strong> and <strong>the organic dream island</strong>, each with distinct environments, characters, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive &amp; Accessible Gameplay</strong> – Simple controls with clear guidance make it easy to jump in, though basic reading comprehension is required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fully Original Chiptune Soundtrack</strong> – Immerse yourself in a dynamic score that adapts to TAC’s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic 8-Bit Pixel Art</strong> – A richly detailed retro aesthetic, handcrafted for an authentic Game Boy experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by One Developer</strong> – A passion project built entirely by <strong>Benjamin McCarthy</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to face the <strong>Dream Shark</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "An 8-bit sci-fi action-adventure game about learning presence through a child's lucid dream.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196360/header.jpg?t=1747323792", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196360/9a3cce045bd8fc3d4627a620ff88a31650c5f88e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747323792", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196360/9a3cce045bd8fc